flowchart LR
    S[Stable Existence / 穩定存在] --> I[Identity / 身分]
    I --> L[Lifecycle State / 生命狀態]
    I --> A[Authority & Rights / 權限]
    I --> E[Evidence & Provenance / 證據與來源]

    I --> H[Human zh-TW / 人類中文表徵]
    I --> X[External EN gated / 對外英文表徵]
    I --> M[Canonical Machine / 機器規範表徵]
    I --> V[Visual-Spatial / 圖像空間表徵]
    I --> N[Domain Native / 領域原生表徵]

    H --> C[Context Assembly / 條件場組裝]
    X --> C
    M --> C
    V --> C
    N --> C

    L --> C
    A --> C
    E --> C

    C --> P[Purpose-specific Projection / 用途投影]
    P --> R[Return / 回流]
    R --> Q[Reconcile / 校準]
    Q --> G[Growth or Metabolism / 成長或代謝]
    G --> I

    O[Superseded / Historical / Failure] -. no current authority .-> E
    O -. explicit request only .-> C
